  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "04. Making Attacks",
    "ruleNumber": "04.00",
    "summary": "Whenever a unit shoots or fights, its attacks are worked out in three numbered steps: [Select Weapons](vsdata:core-rule/select-weapons) (04.01), then [Select Targets](vsdata:core-rule/select-targets) (04.02), then [Resolve Attacks](vsdata:core-rule/resolve-attacks) (04.03). The [active player](vsdata:core-rule/active-player-and-opposing-player) carries them out, and for this purpose the active player is whoever controls the unit that was selected to shoot or fight, until its attacks are resolved (01.03).",
